---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seo = {
  title: "Security | Secure Portfolio Tracker App for Indian Investors",
  description: "Arthavi uses bank-grade encryption and a read-only architecture to keep your investment data safe. We cannot trade or withdraw funds. Learn about our security.",
};
---
<Layout title={seo.title} description={seo.description} keywords="secure portfolio tracker India, encrypted financial app, audit safe investment tracker, read-only access finance app" schema={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [{
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can Arthavi withdraw money from my account?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "No. Arthavi has a strictly read-only architecture. We cannot execute trades, withdraw funds, or move money from your demat or bank accounts."
        }
      }, {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Is my portfolio data encrypted?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes. We use industry-standard AES-256 encryption for data at rest and TLS 1.2+ for data in transit to ensure your financial information is secure."
        }
      }]
    })}
  breadcrumb={{
    items: [
      { name: "Home", url: "https://arthavi.com/" },
      { name: "Security", url: "https://arthavi.com/security" }
    ]
  }}
>


    <main class="container">
        <div class="page-header fade-in">
            <h1>Security at Arthavi</h1>
            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 1.2rem;">Bank-grade protection for your peace of mind.</p>
        </div>

        <article class="prose fade-in delay-100">
            <p>We understand that using a <strong>portfolio tracker in India</strong> requires immense trust. Security
                is not an add-on features for us; it is the foundation of our platform. We adhere to a "Security by
                Design" philosophy to protect your net worth data.</p>

            <h2>Read-Only Architecture (No Risk of Funds)</h2>
            <p>The most robust security feature of Arthavi is what it <strong>cannot</strong> do. As a dedicated
                analytics platform:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>No Withdrawals:</strong> Arthavi has zero capability to initiate transfers or move funds out
                    of your bank or brokerage accounts.</li>
                <li><strong>No Trades:</strong> We cannot sell your stocks or redeem your mutual funds. Even in the
                    theoretical event of an account compromise, your actual assets remain safe with your
                    broker/depository (NSDL/CDSL).</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>End-to-End Encryption</h2>
            <p>We use state-of-the-art encryption standards to ensure your data stays private:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Encryption in Transit:</strong> All data exchanged between your browser/app and our servers
                    is encrypted using <strong>TLS 1.2/1.3 (Transport Layer Security)</strong>, the same standard used
                    by leading Indian banks.</li>
                <li><strong>Encryption at Rest:</strong> Your sensitive portfolio data (holdings, values, goals) is
                    stored in databases protected by <strong>AES-256 encryption</strong>.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Privacy & Data Protection</h2>
            <p>Your financial footprint is yours alone.</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>No Data Sharing:</strong> We do not sell your data to lenders, credit card companies, or ad
                    networks.</li>
                <li><strong>Privacy Mode:</strong> Our dashboard features a "Privacy Mode" that lets you blur monetary
                    values with one click—perfect for checking your <strong>stock portfolio performance</strong> in
                    public spaces.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Authentication & Compliance</h2>
            <p>We employ modern authentication safeguards to prevent unauthorized access:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Secure OAuth integration (Google Login) to avoid storing passwords directly.</li>
                <li>Strict session management to auto-logout on shared devices.</li>
                <li>Compliance with digital data privacy best practices.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Data Deletion Rights</h2>
            <p>You have full control. You can permanently delete your Arthavi account and all associated portfolio data
                instantly from the settings menu. This action is irreversible.</p>

            <p class="text-xs text-muted" style="margin-top: 3rem;"><em>Note: While we employ rigorous security
                    measures, no system is 100% immune to all threats. We practice responsible disclosure and
                    continuously monitor for vulnerabilities to keep Arthavi the secure choice for Indian
                    investors.</em></p>
        </article>
    </main>

    
    

</Layout>
